{
  "_about": "MosaicVPN routing-rule preset: bypass Russian sites. Open the UI's Routing tab and click 'Import .json' to load this file. Every imported rule lands at the bottom of the rule chain; reorder it above any catch-all rules if needed. Rule action is 'direct' so matching traffic skips the tunnel entirely (visits the site from your real ISP, not the egress server). Edit the domain_suffix list below to add or remove entries before importing.",
